Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.61,0:00:09.04,Sign,,0,0,0,,{\fade(800,600)\shad3\blur1\fs60\c&HF1F1F1&}Episode 17 \N {\fs100} Banknote {札の巻}
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.00,Sign,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:00:27.22,0:00:31.01,Narrator,,0,0,0,,This is the daily diet of the Hermit Village—the morning mist. {assuming kasumi = haze (esp. in spring); mist​}
Dialogue: 10,0:00:31.01,0:00:34.04,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Economy-wise, the hermits \Nsure are in a good spot.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:34.04,0:00:38.57,Narrator,,0,0,0,,But today, it's a bit hard \Nto bring yourself to eat it. {??????????}{talking about today's mist}
Dialogue: 10,0:00:45.79,0:00:49.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that? \NWho's the dunce who gathered this mist?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:49.56,0:00:52.20,Default,,0,0,0,,The Senior Disciple \Nis on meal duty today. {anisen - somehow, they shortened anideshi sennin to that ig?}
Dialogue: 10,0:00:52.20,0:00:53.68,Default,,0,0,0,,What, him?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:53.68,0:00:58.26,Default,,0,0,0,,He's been slacking off and gathering only the lousiest of the morning mist again?!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:58.26,0:01:00.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Call him here at once!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:17.36,0:01:18.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Senior Disciple!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:20.94,0:01:23.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Careful!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:24.70,0:01:28.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh gosh, that's what you get for peeping at women bathing, you weirdo!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:28.47,0:01:30.62,Default,,0,0,0,,H-Help me!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:31.66,0:01:36.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Elder is calling for you. \NCome on, hurry up now! Go! {rousensei - sensei is not the same as sen-san so idk how they formed those anymore, but rou still clearly comes from roushi}
Dialogue: 10,0:01:41.54,0:01:43.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you want to tell me something?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:43.50,0:01:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Not just "something"!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:45.10,0:01:48.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Where on earth did you gather \Nthis kind of morning mist?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:48.97,0:01:52.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh. Go ahead, take a bite yourself.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:56.40,0:01:59.65,Default,,0,0,0,,See now? \NSo where did you find that?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:59.65,0:02:01.96,Default,,0,0,0,,To tell you the truth, it's from Tokyo's skies.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:01.96,0:02:03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You imbecile!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:04.20,0:02:10.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you really going to make me \Neat that filthy smog?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:10.71,0:02:15.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Haven’t I told you time and again \Nto gather only the purest mountain mist?!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:15.18,0:02:17.96,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no use telling him anything.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:17.96,0:02:23.27,Default,,0,0,0,,He was peeping on an unsuspecting mortal woman washing herself in a tub when I found him. {????????????????? nc what's that byakai}{下界}
Dialogue: 10,0:02:25.51,0:02:28.15,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not true... not true!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:28.15,0:02:29.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You keep out of it!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:30.14,0:02:33.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Your training is still insufficient!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:33.03,0:02:37.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Go down to the mortal realm \Nand undergo your training once more!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:39.19,0:02:40.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds just right!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:40.58,0:02:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Right now?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:41.94,0:02:42.88,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:42.88,0:02:46.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Disguise yourself as anything \Nyou prefer and go!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:46.51,0:02:48.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What should I transform into?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:48.20,0:02:51.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Anything you can convincingly pull off!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:01.20,0:03:02.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Not that!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:09.05,0:03:10.22,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:14.85,0:03:16.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Still not {\i1}it{\i0}.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:18.77,0:03:19.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Then...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:20.31,0:03:22.24,Default,,0,0,0,,How about this?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:24.48,0:03:25.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop fooling around!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:27.24,0:03:31.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, well then... \NMaybe this year's zodiac, the dragon? {?????}{今年の干支の龍; btw the joke with the seahorses are that they're called 龍の子 or 龍の落とし子 https://jisho.org/search/タツノオトシゴ}
Dialogue: 10,0:03:33.66,0:03:34.75,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a no!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:39.83,0:03:42.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, what a weird dog!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:46.98,0:03:48.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this no good either?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:48.16,0:03:50.99,Default,,0,0,0,,All he does is turning into boring creatures...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:50.99,0:03:53.64,Default,,0,0,0,,He's making me sick...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:59.27,0:04:02.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, for something completely different...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:04.32,0:04:05.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh! Watch out!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:06.69,0:04:09.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, Elder's favorite drink.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:10.26,0:04:12.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah! No, that's a no-no.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:14.08,0:04:16.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, maybe something like this?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:20.92,0:04:23.67,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, that passes.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:25.05,0:04:26.01,Default,,0,0,0,,He's finally done it.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:26.01,0:04:28.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, off with you.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:28.76,0:04:33.42,Narrator,,0,0,0,,And so, he was sent back into the mortal realm... \NWhat kind of turmoil will this entail?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:50.44,0:04:54.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, so this is the Ginza I've heard so much about?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:05.21,0:05:07.40,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, I'll take a little break here. {???????}{一服}
Dialogue: 10,0:05:07.40,0:05:08.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:09.42,0:05:11.26,Default,,0,0,0,,A 1,000 yen note!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:14.05,0:05:16.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Granny, I'd like a polish. {?????????????}
Dialogue: 10,0:05:32.70,0:05:34.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:43.37,0:05:45.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder where she's going now.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:46.84,0:05:48.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll follow along for a bit too.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:03.64,0:06:07.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh! This looks like a splendid theater.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:09.10,0:06:12.32,Default,,0,0,0,,What's with all those people putting on airs?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:25.82,0:06:29.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm... Some of the women here\N are pretty lovely too.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:30.21,0:06:32.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Not bad! {?????????????? Oh my god?}{Umain da!}
Dialogue: 10,0:06:32.00,0:06:34.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Things seem to be going pretty well \Ndown in the mortal realm.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:34.91,0:06:36.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's starting!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:02.99,0:07:04.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Ooh! So cold.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:05.91,0:07:09.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Ooh! I need to stop \Ngetting caught in between like that.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:15.27,0:07:17.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh! This looks more interesting.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:19.35,0:07:21.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, she brushed me off.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:25.56,0:07:28.00,Default,,0,0,0,,They're all so pretentious. {??????? maybe "stout-hearted; firm; courageous; brave; tough"}{気取っだってま}
Dialogue: 10,0:07:29.37,0:07:30.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Ooh, so cold.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:34.23,0:07:37.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Dammit, they all gave me the cold shoulder! \NNow I'm mad!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:37.92,0:07:41.53,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, just you watch what I can do!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:51.08,0:07:52.83,Default,,0,0,0,,This is incredible!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:52.83,0:07:54.65,Default,,0,0,0,,It's raining money!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:54.65,0:07:55.90,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:07:55.90,0:07:58.22,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:08:00.42,0:08:01.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Mine!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:01.20,0:08:02.03,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:08:03.38,0:08:05.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh! Don't touch me!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:05.84,0:08:08.87,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:08:08.87,0:08:12.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a free-for-all here. \NI can't stay in this limelight! {????????????????????????????????? not a word} {大統決戦 逆光線まずい}
Dialogue: 10,0:08:12.40,0:08:16.07,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:08:18.36,0:08:23.13,Default,,0,0,0,,What a shameful lot those mortals are!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:23.79,0:08:28.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder if there's a quieter place \Nfor me somewhere?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:36.25,0:08:37.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:45.76,0:08:50.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, it appears that spring \Nlasts all year in the mortal realm.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:00.15,0:09:04.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh! That looks like a good place for me to rest.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:15.54,0:09:17.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll even have company here.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:19.14,0:09:20.44,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:09:20.44,0:09:22.73,Default,,0,0,0,,That was a tiresome day, all right.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:22.73,0:09:25.74,Default,,0,0,0,,The mortal realm \Nis a pretty stimulating place.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:25.74,0:09:28.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's catch some sleep now...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:28.55,0:09:30.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Like this.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:36.73,0:09:39.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Ooh! Sure is cold today! \NDamn, it's cold!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:44.51,0:09:47.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Three, four, five, six, seven...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:55.74,0:09:57.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it morning already? {?????? maybe  just an achoo?}
Dialogue: 10,0:09:57.69,0:09:59.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I was cold, and it turns out my futon is gone.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:59.73,0:10:02.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, this is bad, \NI'm gonna catch a cold.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:11.05,0:10:14.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Life sure is pain in the mortal realm.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:14.55,0:10:16.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to return to my old house.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:16.87,0:10:21.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, I knew it was hard to live in all along.\NThat's why I was sent here for training, after all.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:22.43,0:10:26.07,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:10:33.82,0:10:35.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm home!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:38.34,0:10:39.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm back!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:41.64,0:10:45.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, welcome back. \NIt was quick, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:45.03,0:10:48.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh? You're looking a bit weird.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:48.36,0:10:52.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You're weird too... I haven't been gone for long, \Nso how did you manage to grow up that much?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:52.86,0:10:55.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, I didn't...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:57.64,0:11:00.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Eek!{? probably a shriek of disgust?}
